for every closed connected oriented smooth <i>n</i>-manifold <i>M</i> and every smooth Riemannian metric <i>g</i>. Here \(\mathop{\mathrm{Scal}}\nolimits _g^-:=\max\{0,-\mathop{\mathrm{Scal}}\nolimits _g\}\), and \(\|M\|\) is real simplicial volume. The proof uses the nonnegative-scalar-curvature vanishing theorem of the companion paper on rational inessentiality.</div>
